        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2011 Teen Choice Awards, 2010 Teen Choice Awards\n- People: Kaley Cuoco, Lucy Hale\n- TV Shows: The Big Bang Theory, Aria Montgomery series\n- Companies: Fox, CBS\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Lucy Hale was named Choice Summer TV Star: Female at the 2010 Teen Choice Awards for her role in the Aria Montgomery series.\n- Since 2007, Kaley Cuoco has starred as Penny on the CBS sitcom The Big Bang Theory.\n- Kaley Cuoco has received Satellite, Critics' Choice, and People's Choice Awards for The Big Bang Theory.\n- On August 7, 2011, the 2011 Teen Choice Awards ceremony aired live at 8/7c on Fox.\n- The 2011 Teen Choice Awards ceremony was hosted by Kaley Cuoco.\n- In 2011, Lucy Hale was named Choice Summer TV Star: Female at the 2011 Teen Choice Awards for her role in the Aria Montgomery series.",
